      "body": "## MDZ.AI - 整合15+顶级AI模型的一站式工具平台\n\n网站链接：https://mdz.ai\n\n### 这是什么？\n\n一个整合了多个顶级AI模型的工具平台 🤖。不用再在ChatGPT、Midjourney、Claude等多个平台间来回切换了！\n\n我在做电商和内容创作时，发现每个月要订阅ChatGPT Plus ($20)、Midjourney ($30)、Claude Pro ($20)等多个工具，月费超过$165。更麻烦的是，不同工具要在不同网站登录使用，效率很低。所以我做了MDZ.AI，把这些AI工具整合到一个平台。\n\n### 核心功能\n\n- **GPT-5 图像生成** - 使用OpenAI最新的图像生成模型\n- **Sora 2 视频创作** - AI驱动的视频生成工具\n- **All-in-One AI聊天** - 整合GPT-4、Claude、Gemini等多个大语言模型\n- **AI产品摄影** - 3-5秒生成专业级产品照片，适合电商卖家\n- **AI Logo设计** - 快速创建专业品牌标识\n- **15+高级AI工具** - 包括视频下载器、音频工具、图像编辑等\n\n### 为什么做这个？\n\n- **省钱** - Pro版$49/月，比单独订阅节省70%以上（原本需要$165+/月）\n- **省时** - 所有AI工具集中在一个平台，无需多次登录\n- **最新模型** - 第一时间接入GPT-5、Sora 2等最新AI模型\n- **免费试用** - 提供免费套餐，无需信用卡即可开始使用\n\n### 适合谁用？\n\n- 电商卖家（Shopify、Amazon、淘宝等）- 快速生成产品图片和营销素材\n- 内容创作者 - 文章、视频、图片一站式创作\n- 设计师 - Logo、海报、UI设计等\n- 开发者和产品经理 - 原型设计、文案生成等\n\n### 定价\n\n- **免费版** - 有限使用额度，体验所有功能\n- **Pro版** - $49/月，包含所有工具和充足的月度积分\n- **终身版** - $1,999一次性付费，永久使用\n\n简单说就是：省去在多个AI工具平台之间来回切换的时间和金钱。\n\n希望对同样需要高效使用AI工具的朋友有帮助！\n\n---\n\n## MDZ.AI - All-in-One AI Toolkit Integrating 15+ Top AI Models\n\n**Website:** https://mdz.ai\n\n### What is this?\n\nA platform that integrates multiple top AI models 🤖. No more switching between ChatGPT, Midjourney, Claude, and other platforms!\n\nWhen doing e-commerce and content creation, I found myself subscribing to ChatGPT Plus ($20), Midjourney ($30), Claude Pro ($20), and more, costing over $165/month. Even worse, I had to log in to different websites for different tools, which was very inefficient. So I built MDZ.AI to integrate these AI tools into one platform.\n\n### Core Features\n\n- **GPT-5 Image Generation** - Using OpenAI's latest image generation model\n- **Sora 2 Video Creation** - AI-driven video generation tool\n- **All-in-One AI Chat** - Integrates GPT-4, Claude, Gemini, and other LLMs\n- **AI Product Photography** - Generate professional product photos in 3-5 seconds, perfect for e-commerce sellers\n- **AI Logo Design** - Quickly create professional brand identities\n- **15+ Premium AI Tools** - Including video downloader, audio tools, image editing, etc.\n\n### Why did I build this?\n\n- **Save Money** - Pro version at $49/month, saving 70%+ compared to individual subscriptions (originally $165+/month)\n- **Save Time** - All AI tools in one platform, no multiple logins needed\n- **Latest Models** - First access to GPT-5, Sora 2, and other latest AI models\n- **Free Trial** - Free tier available, no credit card required to start\n\n### Who is it for?\n\n- E-commerce sellers (Shopify, Amazon, Taobao, etc.) - Quickly generate product images and marketing materials\n- Content creators - Articles, videos, images all in one place\n- Designers - Logo, poster, UI design, etc.\n- Developers and product managers - Prototyping, copywriting, etc.\n\n### Pricing\n\n- **Free Tier** - Limited usage quota, experience all features\n- **Pro Version** - $49/month, includes all tools and ample monthly credits\n- **Lifetime Version** - $1,999 one-time payment, lifetime access\n\nSimply put: saves time and money from switching between multiple AI tool platforms.\n\nHope this helps friends who also need to use AI tools efficiently!",
